Package: ice-nrf24
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, ice-pyendpoint
Description: Endpoint for ZeroC-ICE using nRF24
 This ZeroC Ice endpoint uses an Arduino bridge (which sketch is
 included in this package) connected to a nRF24 transceiver. Although
 witten in Python, it could be used in applications made in other
 languages (as C++, Java, etc.).
